EVEN-graph I(G,2) spectrum (connected, all-even-degree graphs <=7 vertices):
  even-graph spectrum (<=45): [3, 7, 11, 15, 17, 25, 27, 29, 31, 33, 35, 39, 43, 45]
  odd-clique even graphs K_r -> I(K_r,2)=2r+1: {1: 3, 3: 7, 5: 11, 7: 15}
  is 7 in the even-graph spectrum? True  (=> via K_3, the triangle)

TOURNAMENT H-spectrum (achievable, <=45): [3, 5, 9, 11, 13, 15, 17, 19, 23, 25, 27, 29, 31, 33, 35, 37, 39, 41, 43, 45]
  is 7 in the tournament spectrum? False  (NO -- K_3 forbidden as conflict graph)

=== CONTRAST ===
  7 in EVEN-graph spectrum: True;   7 in TOURNAMENT spectrum: False
  21 in EVEN-graph spectrum: False;  21 in TOURNAMENT spectrum: False
  ODD gaps in the even-graph spectrum <=45: [5, 9, 13, 19, 21, 23, 37, 41]
